!bin/**/*.bin
# Numpy-parity fixtures for the host tests (test_sake.c); without them the C-vs-numpy checks
# silently skip rather than fail, on every machine but the one that generated them.
# cheap_testvec.bin (c20_h32 predictor) comes only from MetaboNet's held-out "monitor" subjects.
# testvec.bin (predict.c) and hypo_testvec.bin (hypo.c) are this wearer's own pump/CGM history --
# committed at their explicit request so other builds get the full check too.
!tools/minimed_sake_hosttest/cheap_testvec.bin
!tools/minimed_sake_hosttest/testvec.bin
!tools/minimed_sake_hosttest/hypo_testvec.bin
